## Vulcan surface review — S20-260/270 extended opcode profile

**Scope note before the findings.** The brief describes contract revision 7, slices E1–E6, E7 excluded. At the pinned commit `9dc78fe` the contract is **revision 9** and slice **E7a (`contract_assert`, opcode 144) is landed** with two conformance vectors. Several items the brief asks about were also already repaired after the review request was written (`38866db` shift boundaries, `83d571a` map order, `03e1655` report envelope). I reviewed what is actually at `9dc78fe`. Read-only; no cargo run, so the findings below are code-reading results, not reproductions — confidence stated per item.

